Output tokyonight-demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set Width 960
Set Height 480
Set Theme "TokyoNight"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set Margin 0
Set BorderRadius 8

Type "ls -la"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type "docker info"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type "echo 'hello from tokyo night'"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
